          "texto_completo": "Blanca Hernández Rodríguez: Empleo, Relaciones y Red - MarketScreener España Blanca Hernández Rodríguez Director/Miembro de la Junta en EBRO FOODS, S.A. . 54 relaciones Consumer Services Finance Process Industries Perfil Blanca Hernández Rodríguez is the founder of Magallanes Value Investors SA SGIIC, founded in 2014, serving as Chief Executive Officer. Current jobs include Chief Executive Officer at Grupo Tradifin SL; Chairman & Chief Executive Officer at Techo Hogar SOCIMI SA since 2023; Chairman at Ebro Foundation since 2006; Executive Director at Ebro Foods SA since 2016; Independent Director at Pharma Mar SA since 2019; Director at Azora Europa I SA, Instituto Español de Analistas Financieros, Light Environment Control SL, Real Club Sevilla Golf SL, Tradifin SA, Fundación Capacis, and Proyecto Hombre. Former jobs include Chief Executive Officer at Hispafoods Invest SL and Independent Director at Promotora de Informaciones SA. Education includes an undergraduate degree from Universidad Europea de Madrid SAU in 2004, a graduate degree from Colegio Universitario de Estudios Financieros in 1997, and an undergraduate degree from the University of Seville in 1996. Cargos activos de Blanca Hernández Rodríguez Empresas Cargo Inicio EBRO FOODS, S.A. Director/Miembro de la Junta 21/12/2016 PHARMA MAR, S.A. Director/Miembro de la Junta 25/06/2019 Real Club Sevilla Golf SL Director/Miembro de la Junta - Proyecto Hombre Director/Miembro de la Junta - Instituto Español de Analistas Financieros Instituto Español de Analistas Financieros Other Consumer Services Consumer Services Functions as a College/University Director/Miembro de la Junta - Fundación Capacis Director/Miembro de la Junta - Grupo Tradifin SL Director Ejecutivo - Tradifin SA Director/Miembro de la Junta - Light Environment Control SL Light Environment Control SL Electrical Products Producer Manufacturing Manufactures electric lamp and bulb products Director/Miembro de la Junta - ░░░