          "texto_completo": "Diogo Pimentel: Empleo, Relaciones y Red - MarketScreener España Diogo Pimentel Analyst-Equity en Magallanes Value Investors SA SGIIC . 14 relaciones Finance Consumer Services Perfil Mr. Diogo Pimentel , CFA, is an Analyst at Magallanes Value Investors SA SGIIC. He has over 10 years’ experience in financial markets. Prior to joining Magallanes, Mr. Pimentel held manager and analyst positions at BPI AM and Santander AM. Mr. Pimentel holds degree in Electrical Engineering from Instituto Superior Técnico, Lisbon and a Chartered Financial Analyst. Cargos activos de Diogo Pimentel Empresas Cargo Inicio Magallanes Value Investors SA SGIIC Magallanes Value Investors SA SGIIC Investment Managers Finance Magallanes aims to preserve and increase their clients’ capital by over performing the market in the long-term. The firm follows a value investing philosophy and always looks for the highest ESG standards in their companies. They buy companies when there is a significant difference between price and fundamental value. Analyst-Equity 01/11/2016 Todos los cargos activos de Diogo Pimentel Antiguos cargos conocidos de Diogo Pimentel. Empresas Cargo Fin Santander Asset Management SGOIC SA Santander Asset Management SGOIC SA Investment Managers Finance SAM is an active, growth-oriented manager which invests in global debt and equity across sectors and market-caps. Some of their funds focus on sectors such as telecommunications, media and electronic components, banking and insurance, pharmaceuticals and transportation. The firm invests in Portuguese equity and fixed-income, Euro zone equity and fixed-income, Swiss equity, Norwegian equity, US equity, money market instruments and emerging markets equity. Gestor de Cartera-Acciones 01/06/2012 BPI Gestão de Activos SGOIC SA BPI Gestão de Activos SGOIC SA Investment Managers Finance BPI GA is an active, research-oriented manager which follows a growth-oriented investment style. They invest in global debt and equity across sectors and market-caps, with the bulk of their assets allocated to Continental European companies with a particular focus on Portugal. The firm uses in-house fundamental and technical research. BPI GA typically invests in Portuguese equity and fixed-income, Brazilian equity and fixed-income, US equity and fixed-income, European Union equity and fixed-income, Swiss equity and fixed-income and Norwegian equity and fixed-income. Corporate Officer/Principal 01/07/2008 Santander Asset Management SA SGIIC Santander Asset Management SA SGIIC Investment Managers Finance Santander AM is an active, fundamental, value-oriented manager which invests in global debt and equity across sectors and market-caps. The firm aims to purchase assets which are undervalued but without negative momentum. They combine a bottom-up approach to fundamental analysis with a rigorous risk management process, in order to achieve an active return (alpha) in their investment portfolios. Gestor de Cartera-Acciones - Ver el detalle de la experiencia de Diogo Pimentel. Formación de Diogo Pimentel. Experiencias Funciones ocupadas Activas Inactivas Empresas cotizadas Empresas privadas Ver el detalle de la experiencia de Diogo Pimentel. Relaciones 14 Relaciones de 1er grado 5 Empresas vinculadas al 1er grado Hombre Mujer Administradores Ejecutivos Consultar la red personal Empresas relacionadas Empresas privadas 5 BPI Gestão de Activos SGOIC SA BPI Gestão de Activos SGOIC SA Investment Managers Finance BPI GA is an active, research-oriented manager which follows a growth-oriented investment style. They invest in global debt and equity across sectors and market-caps, with the bulk of their assets allocated to Continental European companies with a particular focus on Portugal. The firm uses in-house fundamental and technical research. BPI GA typically invests in Portuguese equity and fixed-income, Brazilian equity and fixed-income, US equity and fixed-income, European Union equity and fixed-i